  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/#main-content)\n\n# Collaboration  asaService\n\nBundle unified UC applications, AV devices, and IT services.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![hybrid team meeting with collaboration as a service devices](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/shutterstock_2451623445-scaled.webp)\n\n### Bundled Solutions\n\nSimplify procurement and management of hardware, software, training, maintenance, and collaboration technology support. AVI-SPL can do it all for you with our Collaboration as a Service (CaaS) program.\n\n[Schedule a CaaS Workshop](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/#contact)\n\n## What’sincludedinCollaborationasaService\n\nBased on your AV and UC technology roadmap and end-user needs, your CaaS program may include any or all of the following:\n\n- **Hardware** such as video conferencing endpoints and devices, displays, audio systems, microphones, content distribution, and control interfaces\n\n- **Software licensing** fees such as Cisco Webex, Microsoft Teams, or Zoom, and [AVI-SPL Symphony](https://avispl.com/symphony/)\n\n- Deployment, [managed services](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/), and maintenance and support\n\n\n### Key CaaS Benefits\n\nOur CaaS program delivers reliability, ease of use, security, and a consistent user experience. CaaS suits any organization looking to accelerate growth and manage IT resources more efficiently.\n\n![customers reviewing CaaS benefits](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/shutterstock_2449646311-scaled.webp)\n\n#### Lifecycle management\n\nOutsource UC and room technology configuration, interoperability, refresh cycles, and management. Consolidate license renewals and refreshes to ease lifecycle management and platform migrations.\n\n#### Flexibility\n\nFlexible subscription terms from one to five years, with monthly, quarterly, or annual payments. Interest-free options may be available.\n\n#### Lower cost leasing\n\nConserve capital for strategic business investments and align with how you consume other technology, like laptops and mobile phones.\n\nSection\n\nOur Other services\n\n### Keepingyourteamand  yourbusinessconnected\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/#contact)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Managed Services**](https://avispl.com/services/managed-services/) [![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Global Deployment**](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/) [![Lecture hall with rows of chairs, tables facing screens showing AVI-SPL logo; overhead lights, exit signs visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Rose-State-Colleges-Tanenbaum-Aerospace-and-Cybersecurity-Center-tiered-lecture-hall-with-Epson-projectors-on-1024x594.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Professional Services**](https://avispl.com/services/professional-services/)\n\n12\n\n![Woman in orange blouse on video call, holding paper. Notebooks and pen on desk; airy room with plants in background.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/content-module-1.jpg)\n\nCase Studies\n\n### Seamless Customer Experience\n\nHow managed services keep digital signage\n\nrunning at busy airport.\n\n[View More](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/tampa-international-airport-customer-experience/)\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)![Zoom logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/zoom-Logo-2.svg)\n\n[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)![Zoom logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/zoom-Logo-2.svg)",
