olidate license renewals and refreshes to ease lifecycle management and platform migrations.</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-col\">\n                        <h4 class=\"h6\">Flexibility</h4>\n                        <p>Flexible subscription terms from one to five years, with monthly, quarterly, or annual payments. Interest-free options may be available.</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-col\">\n                        <h4 class=\"h6\">Lower cost leasing</h4>\n                        <p>Conserve capital for strategic business investments and align with how you consume other technology, like laptops and mobile phones.</p>\n\n                    </div>\n                            </div>\n        \t</div>\n</section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"video page-block video--template-3\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"video__wrap\" data-id=\"video-block_8cd90270288fbf95e93265bdecb31f2a\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div style=\"padding:56.25% 0 0 0;position:relative\"><div src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/905678289?badge=0&amp;autopause=0&amp;player_id=0&amp;app_id=58479\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture; clipboard-write\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%\" title=\"AVI-SPL Collaboration as a Service\" data-original-tag=\"iframe\"></div></div>\n<p>Section</p>\n\t\t\t\t    </div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"page-slider base-slider page-block page-slider--white\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"page-slider-heading\" aria-roledescription=\"carousel\">\n\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        <div class=\"base-slider__header page-slider__header\">\n        \t<div class=\"base-slider__header__title\">\n\t        \t\t                <p class=\"sub sub--lg\">Our Other services</p>\n\t            \n\t            \t                <h3 id=\"page-slider-heading\" data-splitti